{"candidateAnswer":"Not currently in a relationship","evidence":"[D3:13 | 7:55 pm on 9 June, 2023] Caroline: Yeah, I'm really lucky to have them. They've been there through everything, I've known these friends for 4 years, since I moved from my home country. Their love and help have been so important especially after that tough breakup. I'm super thankful. Who supports you, Mel?\n[D2:14 | 1:14 pm on 25 May, 2023] Caroline: I'm thrilled to make a family for kids who need one. It'll be tough as a single parent, but I'm up for the challenge!","itemId":"urn:uuid:34876039-1b92-51ad-80ee-499d3ea73b82","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:43b344f10dc5f49cdd16a7d6fdde90ce2b553055b3616eeb46815afc115cbdd0","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is Caroline's relationship status?","referenceAnswer":"Single","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"43b344f10dc5f49cdd16a7d6fdde90ce2b553055b3616eeb46815afc115cbdd0"}}]}